WEBVTT

1
00:00:22,041 --> 00:00:25,041
{\an8}IN THIS NEW GAME,
YOUR WIFE IS YOUR "UMPIRE"

2
00:00:25,125 --> 00:00:27,416
WEDDING - R. ELAN (A) ELAVARASAN
S. PAVI (A) PAVITHRA

3
00:00:29,291 --> 00:00:31,750
Your friend is very lucky.

4
00:00:31,833 --> 00:00:35,250
How many people get the chance to marry
the same girl they love?

5
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,791
I didn't get it.

6
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:44,708
Baby, I hope we also can get married
like this one day, right?

7
00:00:44,791 --> 00:00:46,583
It is in your hands, baby.

8
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:47,875
Just say okay.

9
00:00:50,375 --> 00:00:53,333
You keep saying my son
will never amount to anything.

10
00:00:53,416 --> 00:00:57,708
Seeing these two
in their wedding attire makes me so happy!

11
00:00:58,291 --> 00:00:59,375
See!

12
00:00:59,458 --> 00:01:00,916
He actually did it!

13
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:04,916
-We've done our duty.
-Yep.

14
00:01:06,666 --> 00:01:07,791
Take the <i>akshata</i> to bless!

15
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:09,708
Was yours a love marriage?

16
00:01:10,291 --> 00:01:12,250
Love? My <i>appa</i> would've killed me!

17
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:13,916
It was an arranged marriage.

18
00:01:14,666 --> 00:01:16,583
Love can happen anytime in life.

19
00:01:16,666 --> 00:01:19,416
Yeah, yeah. Sure it will.

20
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,625
{\an8}Hello, sweethearts.
Finally the big day is here.

21
00:01:22,708 --> 00:01:24,500
{\an8}Everyone knows today's a special day

22
00:01:24,583 --> 00:01:28,000
{\an8}for your favourite
Instagram Influencer, Purple Pavi.

23
00:01:28,083 --> 00:01:31,458
{\an8}In a few seconds, you're all
going to witness that special moment.

24
00:01:31,541 --> 00:01:32,916
{\an8}Are you guys ready?

25
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,416
{\an8}harish_g - Create couple account soon!

26
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:40,208
{\an8}pearlkumar - By the way dude,
don't tie the knot

27
00:01:40,291 --> 00:01:42,708
{\an8}sharan_sp777
I'm a very big fan of you, sis

28
00:01:42,791 --> 00:01:44,708
{\an8}-Give it, quickly!
-Drums! Louder!

29
00:01:47,333 --> 00:01:50,666
go.w.th.am
Look how your life turned out, Elan

30
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:52,875
Friends_Nesamani
Oh my God!

31
00:01:52,958 --> 00:01:54,916
<i>What's happening?</i>

32
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,041
<i>I don't understand a thing, sir!</i>

33
00:01:57,125 --> 00:01:59,208
<i>Did I blink and miss a whole episode?</i>

34
00:02:09,625 --> 00:02:10,958
Ammu!

35
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,708
<i>Life was awesome until</i>
<i>it was just attraction, romance, and love.</i>

36
00:02:19,791 --> 00:02:22,375
<i>But the moment that third word changed…</i>

37
00:02:26,583 --> 00:02:28,208
<i>Come on, everybody</i>

38
00:02:32,041 --> 00:02:33,625
<i>Atrocity</i>
<i>What happened?</i>

39
00:02:53,375 --> 00:02:56,083
Pavi! Pavi! Come fast.

40
00:02:56,166 --> 00:02:57,125
Coming.

41
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:00,875
Switch on the TV.
The news is about to start.

42
00:03:01,666 --> 00:03:04,125
It's still five minutes to eight, <i>thatha.</i>

43
00:03:05,750 --> 00:03:06,875
-Mwah!
-Hey! Hey!

44
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,291
<i>-Appa,</i> did you take your sugar tablet?
-No.

45
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,750
I'll get it.

46
00:03:17,375 --> 00:03:19,166
<i>-Ma!</i>
-Yes.

47
00:03:19,250 --> 00:03:21,125
Can't you at least remind him?

48
00:03:21,208 --> 00:03:23,000
What?

49
00:03:23,083 --> 00:03:26,583
You talk as if
you're going to stay with us forever.

50
00:03:26,666 --> 00:03:30,041
One day you'll get married
and leave… Hey!

51
00:03:30,125 --> 00:03:32,083
-Why would I leave?
-Then what?

52
00:03:32,166 --> 00:03:33,500
You'll stay here forever?

53
00:03:33,583 --> 00:03:35,916
Get married soon! Okay?

54
00:03:36,583 --> 00:03:37,791
I will see.

55
00:03:39,416 --> 00:03:41,958
<i>Appa,</i> your tablet.
I'll keep it here.

56
00:03:44,250 --> 00:03:46,208
Hi, Momos!

57
00:03:46,291 --> 00:03:48,916
-Good boy.
-How is the hair style?

58
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,833
<i>Appa,</i> take Momos to the pet spa
this evening. You're free, right?

59
00:03:52,916 --> 00:03:55,000
I have to meet the auditor at three.

60
00:03:55,083 --> 00:03:56,166
Okay. I will take care.

61
00:03:56,250 --> 00:03:57,166
Good boy!

62
00:04:03,333 --> 00:04:06,000
Nobody disturb me.
I've got work. Okay?

63
00:04:26,083 --> 00:04:28,208
{\an8}Good morning, sweethearts.

64
00:04:28,291 --> 00:04:30,041
{\an8}Random thoughts… About love…

65
00:04:30,125 --> 00:04:32,500
{\an8}Just because
you like someone at first sight,

66
00:04:32,583 --> 00:04:34,250
{\an8}doesn't mean you have to fall in love.

67
00:04:34,333 --> 00:04:35,583
{\an8}Take it slow. Try dating.

68
00:04:35,666 --> 00:04:37,791
{\an8}Even if you say yes to love,

69
00:04:37,875 --> 00:04:39,416
{\an8}you don't have to get married.

70
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,291
{\an8}If you don't like, you can break up.

71
00:04:41,375 --> 00:04:44,541
{\an8}You don't have to marry first

72
00:04:44,625 --> 00:04:45,791
{\an8}to understand each other.

73
00:04:45,875 --> 00:04:48,041
{\an8}You can even try living together.

74
00:04:49,375 --> 00:04:51,208
{\an8}And above all,

75
00:04:51,291 --> 00:04:52,583
{\an8}love doesn't have to be

76
00:04:52,666 --> 00:04:55,291
{\an8}only between a boy and a girl.

77
00:04:55,375 --> 00:04:58,041
{\an8}This beautiful thing love

78
00:04:58,125 --> 00:04:59,541
{\an8}has become so progressive.

79
00:04:59,625 --> 00:05:04,375
{\an8}But are all boys
really this progressive?

80
00:05:04,458 --> 00:05:06,375
{\an8}That's the big question.

81
00:05:22,416 --> 00:05:25,083
<i>Why are you just staring at the photo?</i>

82
00:05:25,750 --> 00:05:27,291
<i>Just say yes to one girl.</i>

83
00:05:28,166 --> 00:05:30,791
<i>Their families are waiting for an answer.</i>

84
00:05:30,875 --> 00:05:31,958
Blocked.

85
00:05:34,833 --> 00:05:37,875
<i>Why was I born?</i>

86
00:05:46,625 --> 00:05:49,791
<i>Why did I grow up?</i>

87
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:58,041
Yes, rooftop. Yes, done.

88
00:05:58,125 --> 00:05:59,625
I am standing under the sun.

89
00:05:59,708 --> 00:06:00,916
Hey, I'm coming! Hang up!

90
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,666
God…

91
00:06:09,833 --> 00:06:10,708
Good morning.

92
00:06:12,208 --> 00:06:13,500
Welcome, sir. You can go, sir.

93
00:06:13,583 --> 00:06:15,583
No, no, no. Do your job. Do your job.

94
00:06:15,666 --> 00:06:16,958
Okay, boss. If you insist.

95
00:06:17,041 --> 00:06:18,083
Yes, I insist.

96
00:06:18,875 --> 00:06:19,833
You can go now, sir.

97
00:06:19,916 --> 00:06:21,250
This is how you do your job?

98
00:06:21,833 --> 00:06:22,875
Check the bag also.

99
00:06:25,708 --> 00:06:27,125
Sir!

100
00:06:27,208 --> 00:06:28,666
There are two, right?

101
00:06:34,583 --> 00:06:36,916
You are terminated. Get out.

102
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,708
<i>Appa,</i> I lost my job.

103
00:06:39,791 --> 00:06:41,375
-Forgot the spicy chutney.
-What?

104
00:06:41,458 --> 00:06:43,125
No, <i>Appa.</i> I did my work properly.

105
00:06:43,208 --> 00:06:45,333
Office politics, that's what happened.

106
00:06:45,416 --> 00:06:46,416
-Who?
-Wait.

107
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:48,625
-Can't look for another job…
-Your favourite chutney.

108
00:06:48,708 --> 00:06:50,208
…as they cancelled my work permit.

109
00:06:50,291 --> 00:06:51,541
-What?
-Let me serve you some.

110
00:06:51,625 --> 00:06:52,666
<i>Appa,</i> is <i>Amma</i> there?

111
00:06:53,291 --> 00:06:54,333
Your son.

112
00:06:56,916 --> 00:06:58,166
Elan.

113
00:06:58,250 --> 00:07:00,000
I struggled here for one and a half years

114
00:07:00,083 --> 00:07:02,208
and repaid every rupee
<i>Appa</i> spent to get me this job.

115
00:07:02,291 --> 00:07:04,000
I can't stay here anymore.

116
00:07:04,083 --> 00:07:06,416
<i>I miss our home,</i>
<i>your dosas,</i> aaya's <i>sweet,</i>

117
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,875
<i>my brother,</i> anni, <i>the kids…</i>

118
00:07:07,958 --> 00:07:10,375
<i>I even miss</i> Appa's <i>scoldings, you know?</i>

119
00:07:10,458 --> 00:07:12,041
<i>Let me come home,</i> Amma.

120
00:07:12,125 --> 00:07:14,875
How'd you say this all of a sudden?
How do I handle your <i>appa?</i>

121
00:07:14,958 --> 00:07:17,875
<i>Amma,</i> do you know how much
I miss all of you?

122
00:07:17,958 --> 00:07:20,000
Didn't you miss me at all, <i>Amma?</i>

123
00:07:22,375 --> 00:07:25,541
Do you know how hard it was without you?

124
00:07:25,625 --> 00:07:27,208
I missed you too, son.

125
00:07:27,291 --> 00:07:28,291
Me too, <i>Amma.</i>

126
00:07:28,375 --> 00:07:30,500
-You don't have to work anymore, son.
-Okay.

127
00:07:30,583 --> 00:07:33,250
Even if you just stay at home,
I'll take care of you.

128
00:07:33,333 --> 00:07:34,833
I'll feed you.

129
00:07:34,916 --> 00:07:36,458
Don't cry. I'm here with you now.

130
00:07:36,541 --> 00:07:39,250
Stay here with us.
I can't live without you.

131
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Dear God, protect him from the evil eye

132
00:07:44,083 --> 00:07:47,291
of all beings and harmful people.

133
00:07:49,333 --> 00:07:50,166
Spit.

134
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,041
Now go take a bath!

135
00:07:57,041 --> 00:08:00,333
What's this? Make the dosas nice
and crispy. Otherwise he won't eat.

136
00:08:00,416 --> 00:08:02,250
Okay, <i>athai</i>.

137
00:08:02,333 --> 00:08:05,625
-Sister-in-law, is that a ghee dosa?
-Hey.

138
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:08,500
I'm making it. Go bathe and come.

139
00:08:08,583 --> 00:08:09,625
Okay!

140
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:13,166
<i>Anna,</i> why is Chennai so hot?

141
00:08:13,791 --> 00:08:15,166
How are you coping?

142
00:08:15,250 --> 00:08:17,791
Hey! You weren't even abroad
for a year and a half.

143
00:08:17,875 --> 00:08:20,375
And you have already
visited us five times.

144
00:08:20,458 --> 00:08:21,500
Isn't that too much?

145
00:08:23,583 --> 00:08:26,875
<i>Chithha,</i> when are you going abroad again?

146
00:08:26,958 --> 00:08:28,666
I'm not going back.

147
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:29,875
I'm staying here.

148
00:08:29,958 --> 00:08:32,375
I'll get chocolates
from the corner shop.

149
00:08:32,458 --> 00:08:34,791
These are gold coin chocolates!
One for each of you.

150
00:08:34,875 --> 00:08:36,083
-Hey!
-Yes?

151
00:08:39,083 --> 00:08:40,583
I need to talk to you.

152
00:08:41,333 --> 00:08:42,333
Come inside.

153
00:08:44,791 --> 00:08:46,750
Move aside. Where is it?

154
00:08:48,041 --> 00:08:49,791
For <i>Appa.</i> Special item.

155
00:08:52,083 --> 00:08:55,250
Go, go! He is also waiting
with a special surprise.

156
00:08:56,458 --> 00:08:57,625
Congratulations.

157
00:09:07,625 --> 00:09:08,875
<i>Appa!</i>

158
00:09:11,583 --> 00:09:12,750
Isn't this very expensive?

159
00:09:13,791 --> 00:09:15,666
Why would I think about the price
when it's meant for you?

160
00:09:22,416 --> 00:09:23,750
What are you going to do about your job?

161
00:09:23,833 --> 00:09:26,458
My friend Vishwanathan has arranged

162
00:09:26,541 --> 00:09:28,250
a job for me in Chennai.

163
00:09:28,333 --> 00:09:29,833
I'll join next week.

164
00:09:29,916 --> 00:09:31,166
Trustworthy?

165
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:32,916
<i>Appa!</i> It is Vishwanathan!

166
00:09:35,041 --> 00:09:36,208
You take care of your job.

167
00:09:37,375 --> 00:09:38,916
I'll take care of the rest.

168
00:09:42,833 --> 00:09:43,916
I sent you a number.

169
00:09:45,291 --> 00:09:46,625
It's my friend's daughter.

170
00:09:46,708 --> 00:09:48,166
She's perfect for our family.

171
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:49,541
I'll handle everything else.

172
00:09:50,125 --> 00:09:52,291
You just go meet her. That's it.

173
00:09:53,125 --> 00:09:54,416
<i>Appa,</i> what is this?

174
00:09:56,125 --> 00:09:58,458
Nothing, <i>Appa!</i>

175
00:09:59,708 --> 00:10:03,000
<i>Appa!</i> You forgot to send me her photo.

176
00:10:03,083 --> 00:10:06,833
Why? So you can reject her saying
her eyes, ears or nose aren't perfect?

177
00:10:06,916 --> 00:10:08,166
No photo this time.

178
00:10:08,250 --> 00:10:10,583
-Go!
-Okay, <i>Appa!</i>

179
00:10:13,208 --> 00:10:16,666
-I'm going to win.
-See, I won.

180
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:18,791
Ilavarasa! Ilavarasa!

181
00:10:18,875 --> 00:10:21,333
<i>Aaya!</i> How many times have I told you?
Just call me Elan!

182
00:10:21,416 --> 00:10:22,791
Take everything upstairs!

183
00:10:22,875 --> 00:10:24,208
<i>Chithha </i>will be staying here.

184
00:10:24,291 --> 00:10:27,666
I made your favourite
sweet dumplings. Eat.

185
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:34,833
Why do you look upset?

186
00:10:35,708 --> 00:10:37,291
-I just landed today.
-Yes.

187
00:10:37,375 --> 00:10:40,041
How can he give me a girl's number
and talk about marriage so soon?

188
00:10:40,125 --> 00:10:43,125
Since I was a kid, I've believed
in <i>Pyaar, prema,</i> and <i>kaadhal.</i>

189
00:10:43,875 --> 00:10:45,375
Who's this "R. Prema"?

190
00:10:47,541 --> 00:10:48,375
Love, <i>aaya.</i>

191
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:53,000
I came here to find a girl, fall in love,
and then get married.

192
00:10:53,083 --> 00:10:55,000
At least meet her first.

193
00:10:55,083 --> 00:10:57,166
This love can happen there also.

194
00:10:57,250 --> 00:10:59,583
How can I meet someone
without even seeing her face?

195
00:10:59,666 --> 00:11:00,791
See here.

196
00:11:00,875 --> 00:11:03,000
You have her number, right?

197
00:11:03,083 --> 00:11:04,083
Just click on it.

198
00:11:04,708 --> 00:11:05,958
You'll get her photo by default

199
00:11:06,041 --> 00:11:07,500
on WhatsApp.

200
00:11:09,083 --> 00:11:10,125
<i>-Aaya.</i>
-What?

201
00:11:10,208 --> 00:11:12,291
You are not <i>aaya,</i> you're idea.

202
00:11:12,375 --> 00:11:14,958
-You dumb fellow! Go.
-Let me check it right away.

203
00:11:15,041 --> 00:11:20,000
Wow! Such beautiful eyes, nose, and lips.

204
00:11:20,083 --> 00:11:23,500
Although the tongue is the real highlight!
Your fiancée is superb!

205
00:11:24,750 --> 00:11:26,083
Is that enough?

206
00:11:27,708 --> 00:11:28,875
You cannot decide that.

207
00:11:28,958 --> 00:11:31,500
I'm the one who decides when it's enough!

208
00:11:32,416 --> 00:11:33,416
Always joking.

209
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:35,583
Whenever I try to be serious,
she thinks I'm joking.

210
00:11:35,666 --> 00:11:37,958
Message her and ask for her photo.

211
00:11:38,625 --> 00:11:39,708
Will do it right now.

212
00:11:40,541 --> 00:11:43,583
Hi! Please send your photo!

213
00:11:43,666 --> 00:11:45,083
Hey! Hey! Stupid!

214
00:11:45,166 --> 00:11:48,416
Is this how you will text
a girl for a photo? Give me the phone.

215
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:49,708
2K kids!

216
00:11:49,791 --> 00:11:51,416
Hi, I'm Elan here.

217
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:53,166
See, she's typing.

218
00:11:54,458 --> 00:11:55,291
See.

219
00:11:55,791 --> 00:11:58,125
What does "Hiii" with three i's mean?

220
00:11:58,208 --> 00:11:59,541
What does it mean?

221
00:11:59,625 --> 00:12:01,750
It means she really likes you. Watch now!

222
00:12:01,833 --> 00:12:06,708
Your DP has such a cute dog.

223
00:12:08,166 --> 00:12:09,750
She wrote "thank you!"

224
00:12:09,833 --> 00:12:11,583
Now, you see my "rizz"!

225
00:12:12,125 --> 00:12:15,500
Now we would love to see
who's the cute owner

226
00:12:15,583 --> 00:12:16,875
of the…

227
00:12:17,458 --> 00:12:19,125
-cute dog.
-"I."

228
00:12:19,958 --> 00:12:21,500
I would love to see.

229
00:12:22,791 --> 00:12:24,958
She sent something!

230
00:12:25,041 --> 00:12:26,500
Come on guys, sit down.

231
00:12:26,583 --> 00:12:28,666
One, two, three.

232
00:12:29,416 --> 00:12:30,583
What is this?

233
00:12:31,083 --> 00:12:33,875
You can see the face
of the cute dog's owner

234
00:12:33,958 --> 00:12:37,125
in person tomorrow.

235
00:12:37,208 --> 00:12:39,125
I'll come wearing this outfit.

236
00:12:39,958 --> 00:12:42,375
So, are you not wearing anything now?

237
00:12:42,458 --> 00:12:44,958
-Dude!
-Sorry. Deleted it.

238
00:12:52,333 --> 00:12:55,166
What now? Is this the end?
Life ended or what?

239
00:12:55,250 --> 00:12:57,458
-Look at that nutcase. Talking to himself.
-Yeah, baby.

240
00:12:58,333 --> 00:13:00,541
Let me meet her.
If I like her, I'll say okay.

241
00:13:00,625 --> 00:13:02,291
Or I can act like a fool and leave.

242
00:13:02,375 --> 00:13:03,750
Hey. Come.

243
00:13:24,208 --> 00:13:28,458
<i>I'm caught in the corner</i>
<i>Of your eye, girl</i>

244
00:13:29,666 --> 00:13:33,541
<i>I fell in love in an instant, girl</i>

245
00:13:35,291 --> 00:13:38,708
<i>I saw my life falling apart</i>

246
00:13:39,958 --> 00:13:44,125
<i>My blood froze</i>

