Hey. If the bride does not show up,
will we get paid?

739
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:19,875
Don't know, man.

740
00:40:20,958 --> 00:40:24,000
-What a disaster.
-Grandma, take this.

741
00:40:24,083 --> 00:40:25,458
Go away. As if I need coffee.

742
00:40:25,541 --> 00:40:28,625
I told you earlier.
There is a girl in the village.

743
00:40:28,708 --> 00:40:30,541
-Aunt.
-They'll gift the girl generous gold.

744
00:40:30,625 --> 00:40:32,500
-Not a problem.
-Here.

745
00:40:32,583 --> 00:40:34,541
Be glad the first night didn't happen.

746
00:40:35,500 --> 00:40:37,208
You get me?

747
00:40:37,291 --> 00:40:38,583
Here. Drink this coffee.

748
00:40:42,583 --> 00:40:44,416
What's happened has happened, <i>mama.</i>

749
00:40:44,500 --> 00:40:46,125
What's the point in being quiet?

750
00:40:46,708 --> 00:40:48,250
See what can be done next.

751
00:40:49,750 --> 00:40:50,750
Sir?

752
00:40:50,833 --> 00:40:51,791
What, man?

753
00:40:51,875 --> 00:40:55,166
-Sir, payment?
-Payment without playing anything?

754
00:40:55,250 --> 00:40:57,500
Play something and take it.

755
00:40:57,583 --> 00:41:00,000
-We will play at once.
<i>-What happened? When will you come?</i>

756
00:41:00,083 --> 00:41:01,333
They will soon end this.

757
00:41:05,375 --> 00:41:06,500
They have started.

758
00:41:19,541 --> 00:41:21,041
Rest in peace.

759
00:41:28,916 --> 00:41:30,375
What are they saying in Insta?

760
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:33,333
#RunPaviRun is trending, ma'am.

761
00:41:33,416 --> 00:41:35,166
They are roasting you intensely.

762
00:41:35,250 --> 00:41:36,333
Look at this.

763
00:41:38,375 --> 00:41:39,875
<i>The bride who cheated</i>

764
00:41:39,958 --> 00:41:41,791
<i>by putting on an innocent face.</i>

765
00:41:41,875 --> 00:41:43,708
<i>Uncle's trousers came down.</i>

766
00:41:43,791 --> 00:41:45,708
<i>The groom's dhoti flew away.</i>

767
00:41:45,791 --> 00:41:47,166
<i>You are beautiful.</i>

768
00:41:47,250 --> 00:41:48,583
<i>Can I marry you?</i>

769
00:41:48,666 --> 00:41:50,375
<i>I love marriage.</i>

770
00:41:50,458 --> 00:41:51,416
<i>I'll come.</i>

771
00:41:51,500 --> 00:41:54,500
{\an8}meowdas_memes
Varta uncle vroom

772
00:41:54,583 --> 00:41:58,208
{\an8}<i>-Where are you running off?</i>
<i>-I said I'll get married,</i>

773
00:41:58,291 --> 00:41:59,750
{\an8}<i>not come to your house.</i>

774
00:41:59,833 --> 00:42:01,416
{\an8}<i>Goodbye. Toodles.</i>

775
00:42:01,500 --> 00:42:02,541
{\an8}<i>What the f***!</i>

776
00:42:03,250 --> 00:42:05,708
<i>There are so many laws to protect women.</i>

777
00:42:05,791 --> 00:42:08,125
<i>But for men… Isn't that wrong?</i>

778
00:42:08,208 --> 00:42:11,125
<i>There are a lot of toxic women like this.</i>

779
00:42:11,208 --> 00:42:13,666
<i>-She's actually the real Red Flag.</i>
<i>-What?</i>

780
00:42:16,083 --> 00:42:18,125
We need to do something, ma'am.

781
00:42:18,208 --> 00:42:20,250
What you did so far is not enough?

782
00:42:20,333 --> 00:42:24,000
Don't all girls get married and go
to their husband's house?

783
00:42:24,541 --> 00:42:25,708
How is this happening?

784
00:42:25,791 --> 00:42:29,041
That the one I gave birth
thinks in such myriad ways.

785
00:42:29,125 --> 00:42:30,166
Chandra!

786
00:42:30,250 --> 00:42:32,458
Give her time to think.

787
00:42:33,500 --> 00:42:35,125
God!

788
00:42:35,208 --> 00:42:37,291
You won't see a dad like him
anywhere else.

789
00:42:37,375 --> 00:42:41,000
Oh, dear. Oh, dear. My head is spinning.

790
00:42:41,083 --> 00:42:45,125
Oh, God. What am I going to tell
my son-in-law's family?

791
00:42:45,208 --> 00:42:48,125
You have humiliated us so much
that we can never step out.

792
00:42:48,208 --> 00:42:50,000
Ma'am. Look at this reel.

793
00:42:50,083 --> 00:42:52,416
She and her stupid assistant.

794
00:42:54,291 --> 00:42:55,541
Cheers!

795
00:42:55,625 --> 00:42:57,000
Don't yell. We could get caught.

796
00:42:57,666 --> 00:43:00,708
Elan. Do you know how a wife should be?

797
00:43:00,791 --> 00:43:03,916
Listen. When I get home from work,
I knock on my door.

798
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:06,791
My wife will be standing at the door
with my jaggery coffee.

799
00:43:06,875 --> 00:43:08,125
I'll give her a look.

800
00:43:08,208 --> 00:43:10,666
-She'll be at my foot.
-To trip you up?

801
00:43:10,750 --> 00:43:12,916
No. To unlace my shoes.

802
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:16,291
Know where a wife should be?

803
00:43:16,958 --> 00:43:18,125
She should be here.

804
00:43:18,208 --> 00:43:21,291
-Get it?
-So his wife should also be like that?

805
00:43:21,375 --> 00:43:23,958
What's your doubt? Who are you?

806
00:43:24,666 --> 00:43:25,583
Who are you?

807
00:43:25,666 --> 00:43:26,666
Who?

808
00:43:26,750 --> 00:43:28,500
-A man.
-Yes, sir.

809
00:43:28,583 --> 00:43:29,958
She showed you who she was.

810
00:43:30,041 --> 00:43:32,541
Now it's time you showed her who you are.

811
00:43:32,625 --> 00:43:35,416
Correct, Ganesh. Here. Take it, man.

812
00:43:35,500 --> 00:43:37,000
-Drink up, I say.
-Drink.

813
00:43:37,083 --> 00:43:39,250
Drink it up fully
and go to your wife's house.

814
00:43:39,333 --> 00:43:43,541
Beat her up, choke her neck
and drag her back to your house

815
00:43:43,625 --> 00:43:45,416
Let's go, Vinoth <i>anna!</i>
Come on, let's go now.

816
00:43:49,583 --> 00:43:52,875
Go. Your gate is open.

817
00:43:52,958 --> 00:43:55,666
-Let her know the power of a man.
-Look at his rage.

818
00:44:25,750 --> 00:44:26,833
Why are you here?

819
00:44:31,083 --> 00:44:32,833
I'm here to prove that I'm a man.

820
00:44:40,000 --> 00:44:41,666
Oh, yeah?

821
00:44:41,750 --> 00:44:42,875
Then prove.

822
00:44:48,250 --> 00:44:49,250
Give me a minute.

823
00:44:53,833 --> 00:44:56,833
It's been so long since he went up.
Still no sign of him.

824
00:44:56,916 --> 00:44:58,500
Did he do something in his rage?

825
00:44:59,291 --> 00:45:01,583
You instigated him.

826
00:45:01,666 --> 00:45:04,708
If he does something,
you will be caught by the police.

827
00:45:04,791 --> 00:45:05,708
I'll get caught?

828
00:45:05,791 --> 00:45:07,375
-Put your leg down.
-Police!

829
00:45:07,458 --> 00:45:08,583
-Police?
-No!

830
00:45:08,666 --> 00:45:13,291
Michael sir. I'm drunk and on the wheels.
They will arrest me for drunken disorder.

831
00:45:13,375 --> 00:45:16,000
Come on, sir. Come push this. Push, sir.

832
00:45:18,125 --> 00:45:20,791
Oh, God, the SI is close. What do we do?

833
00:45:20,875 --> 00:45:24,750
Ganesh, which police man
is given an orange colour uniform?

834
00:45:24,833 --> 00:45:27,250
He goes in like a thief,
but comes out like the house owner.

835
00:45:27,333 --> 00:45:29,250
He bought something.

836
00:45:29,333 --> 00:45:31,500
He won't tell us what he bought.

837
00:45:31,583 --> 00:45:34,583
-Hey! Stop!
-What did you deliver?

838
00:45:34,666 --> 00:45:37,458
-We can't reveal what we deliver.
-You can't?

839
00:45:37,541 --> 00:45:40,250
-The bottle piece will go up your nose.
<i>-Anna!</i>

840
00:45:40,333 --> 00:45:42,500
-Tell us the truth.
-We don't know either.

841
00:45:42,583 --> 00:45:46,333
But when I touched it,
it felt like a small square box.

842
00:45:46,916 --> 00:45:48,458
A square box?

843
00:46:04,500 --> 00:46:05,875
<i>Oh, Dad, did you hear?</i>

844
00:46:05,958 --> 00:46:08,708
<i>Oh, what an idea</i>

845
00:46:08,791 --> 00:46:10,500
<i>Mom, you are naughty</i>

846
00:46:10,583 --> 00:46:14,708
<i>Dad, did you see it</i>

847
00:46:19,083 --> 00:46:20,333
Shall we go home, Ammu?

848
00:46:21,208 --> 00:46:23,125
We are home, Chinnu.

849
00:46:24,208 --> 00:46:25,833
Not that, Ammu…

850
00:46:25,916 --> 00:46:27,291
Shall we go to our house?

851
00:46:28,583 --> 00:46:29,666
Chinnu!

852
00:46:29,750 --> 00:46:31,333
We are in our house, Chinnu.

853
00:46:33,458 --> 00:46:34,375
Ammu!

854
00:46:35,333 --> 00:46:36,166
Chinnu!

855
00:46:36,875 --> 00:46:38,541
Will you come to my house or not?

856
00:46:40,208 --> 00:46:42,208
I cannot come to your house.

857
00:46:43,708 --> 00:46:45,333
Why don't you come to my house?

858
00:46:53,625 --> 00:46:57,875
Hey! She has asked him
to be a live-in husband at her place.

859
00:46:59,833 --> 00:47:02,833
Let me go. We got you married
to that girl at your request, right?

860
00:47:02,916 --> 00:47:03,791
Say something, man!

861
00:47:06,250 --> 00:47:07,375
<i>Amma!</i>

862
00:47:07,458 --> 00:47:08,791
My legs and arms ache.

863
00:47:08,875 --> 00:47:11,125
Can you get me the medicine
for exhaustion please?

864
00:47:13,958 --> 00:47:15,916
Wait, let me get it.

865
00:47:17,333 --> 00:47:18,333
Come, let's go.

866
00:47:18,416 --> 00:47:21,958
God knows how my son suffered the night
with no place to sleep.

867
00:47:25,000 --> 00:47:26,041
Darling,

868
00:47:26,125 --> 00:47:27,750
what did I touch in your pocket?

869
00:47:27,833 --> 00:47:28,833
Chocolate?

870
00:47:28,916 --> 00:47:31,166
<i>Aaya,</i> massage below the knees only.

871
00:47:40,708 --> 00:47:42,208
-Hello!
-Pavi ma'am.

872
00:47:42,291 --> 00:47:45,916
I'm tortured with calls from media
every five minutes.

873
00:47:46,000 --> 00:47:47,291
I don't know what to say.

874
00:47:47,375 --> 00:47:50,166
<i>All the negativity is on you, ma'am.</i>

875
00:47:50,250 --> 00:47:53,041
I think you should give an interview

876
00:47:53,125 --> 00:47:56,250
and explain your stance
to do some damage control.

877
00:47:56,875 --> 00:47:58,375
-What do you say?
-No, Ash.

878
00:47:58,875 --> 00:48:00,375
I'm not worried about Instagram.

879
00:48:01,541 --> 00:48:02,750
Elan will come.

880
00:48:02,833 --> 00:48:03,916
I believe it.

881
00:48:23,958 --> 00:48:27,250
Brother, set it there. There.

882
00:48:28,625 --> 00:48:30,166
-Careful.
-What's this, dear?

883
00:48:30,250 --> 00:48:32,375
Your daughter is acting weirdly.

884
00:48:32,458 --> 00:48:35,291
Who will accept this kind of behaviour?

885
00:48:35,375 --> 00:48:36,250
<i>Anna.</i> Not there.

886
00:48:36,333 --> 00:48:37,208
Look here.

887
00:48:37,291 --> 00:48:39,791
Before something is decided
in our <i>mapillai's</i> house,

888
00:48:39,875 --> 00:48:41,875
let us both go talk to them.

889
00:48:42,666 --> 00:48:46,250
What's this? Like your daughter,
you too are keeping quiet.

890
00:48:46,916 --> 00:48:48,250
Anyone home?

891
00:48:48,333 --> 00:48:49,541
-Look at her go.
<i>-Akka?</i>

892
00:48:49,625 --> 00:48:50,708
Are you Pavithra?

893
00:48:50,791 --> 00:48:54,208
All the gifts she's supposed to take
to her husband's house are piled up here.

894
00:48:54,291 --> 00:48:57,250
You've spoilt her too much.

895
00:48:58,083 --> 00:49:00,875
Talking to you or to the wall
are one and the same.

896
00:49:23,625 --> 00:49:26,916
Ash! Tell them I okayed the interview.

897
00:49:31,583 --> 00:49:35,333
The chief guest for our show today
needs no introduction.

898
00:49:35,416 --> 00:49:37,083
#RunPaviRun.

899
00:49:37,166 --> 00:49:38,875
#Mrs. Marathon.

900
00:49:38,958 --> 00:49:40,916
#Lady Usain Bolt.

901
00:49:41,000 --> 00:49:44,625
The lady behind these hashtags is here.

902
00:49:44,708 --> 00:49:46,000
Welcome to the show,

903
00:49:46,083 --> 00:49:47,375
{\an8}Miss…

904
00:49:47,458 --> 00:49:48,666
{\an8}Mrs…

905
00:49:48,750 --> 00:49:50,458
{\an8}Sorry, how do I address you?

906
00:49:51,250 --> 00:49:52,666
Before marriage

907
00:49:52,750 --> 00:49:54,958
and after marriage,
my name is Pavi.

908
00:49:56,166 --> 00:49:57,208
You can call me Pavi.

909
00:49:57,291 --> 00:49:58,666
Interesting.

910
00:49:59,250 --> 00:50:01,166
Generally, once a woman is married,

911
00:50:01,250 --> 00:50:03,250
she adopts her husband's name
as a surname.

912
00:50:03,333 --> 00:50:04,875
Isn't that the tradition?

913
00:50:04,958 --> 00:50:06,250
Exactly!

914
00:50:06,333 --> 00:50:08,375
It's a tradition, not condition.

915
00:50:09,000 --> 00:50:11,916
So isn't marriage a tradition?

916
00:50:12,000 --> 00:50:14,041
So why did you get married?

917
00:50:14,125 --> 00:50:16,000
I liked the tradition of marriage.

918
00:50:16,083 --> 00:50:17,375
So I married.

919
00:50:18,583 --> 00:50:19,916
But

920
00:50:20,000 --> 00:50:22,708
I did not like the condition
that only the girl has to live

921
00:50:22,791 --> 00:50:24,041
in her husband's house.

922
00:50:25,083 --> 00:50:25,916
So I did not go.

923
00:50:26,000 --> 00:50:27,166
Okay, madam.

924
00:50:27,250 --> 00:50:30,375
But you should have thought of it
before getting married.

925
00:50:30,458 --> 00:50:32,125
You're speaking up now?

926
00:50:34,916 --> 00:50:36,166
Are you married?

927
00:50:36,791 --> 00:50:38,083
No.

928
00:50:38,166 --> 00:50:39,708
When you get married,

929
00:50:40,208 --> 00:50:44,583
and it is time for you
to leave your parents and home,

930
00:50:45,708 --> 00:50:46,916
then you will understand.

931
00:50:47,958 --> 00:50:50,041
Okay, madam. I don't get it.

932
00:50:51,041 --> 00:50:54,083
But didn't you and your husband
fall in love and get married?

933
00:50:54,166 --> 00:50:55,750
We don't get it.

934
00:50:55,833 --> 00:50:57,625
Your husband didn't understand either?

935
00:51:01,041 --> 00:51:02,916
I'm not here to discuss my husband

936
00:51:03,875 --> 00:51:06,791
or increase my Instagram followers.

937
00:51:07,375 --> 00:51:09,458
-So…
-What, ma'am?

938
00:51:09,541 --> 00:51:10,500
You say this,

939
00:51:10,583 --> 00:51:13,875
but your husband
is very eager to talk to you.

940
00:51:13,958 --> 00:51:15,375
He is on hold.

941
00:51:15,458 --> 00:51:16,458
Shall I connect him?

942
00:51:16,541 --> 00:51:17,625
<i>Brother!</i>

943
00:51:17,708 --> 00:51:19,958
<i>You should know the statistics</i>
<i>when you talk.</i>

944
00:51:20,041 --> 00:51:21,458
<i>Okay!</i>

945
00:51:23,125 --> 00:51:24,500
Tell me, ma'am.

946
00:51:33,250 --> 00:51:36,000
If you are not at fault,
you can talk to him, right?

947
00:51:38,416 --> 00:51:39,250
Go ahead!

948
00:51:39,958 --> 00:51:42,250
Connect the call to her husband.

949
00:51:42,333 --> 00:51:44,458
<i>Yeah. Hello, Elan.</i>

950
00:51:44,541 --> 00:51:46,041
<i>Your wife is here.</i>

951
00:51:46,125 --> 00:51:47,125
<i>You can talk.</i>

952
00:51:48,083 --> 00:51:48,916
Ammu!

953
00:51:49,000 --> 00:51:52,083
Why are you shaming me and my family
by discussing this in the media?

954
00:51:52,166 --> 00:51:54,708
My intention is not to shame anyone.

955
00:51:55,500 --> 00:51:58,708
Then come home immediately.
Let's discuss it with the family.

956
00:52:00,583 --> 00:52:02,041
What a drama, Elan.

957
00:52:02,125 --> 00:52:03,708
Am I acting?

958
00:52:03,791 --> 00:52:06,416
You are the one creating
scene after scene since the wedding.

959
00:52:06,500 --> 00:52:07,875
Do you know how my family suffers?

960
00:52:10,250 --> 00:52:11,583
Your family suffers?

961
00:52:12,083 --> 00:52:13,041
Then…

962
00:52:14,916 --> 00:52:16,000
what is this?

963
00:52:16,583 --> 00:52:17,541
What is this?

964
00:52:17,625 --> 00:52:19,833
Was it sent without you
or your family's knowledge?

965
00:52:19,916 --> 00:52:21,833
This was not on our list.
Zoom on her.

966
00:52:21,916 --> 00:52:23,166
<i>What happened?</i>

967
00:52:23,250 --> 00:52:24,083
<i>What's going on?</i>

968
00:52:24,166 --> 00:52:25,708
<i>Arangunathan is a monkey now.</i>

969
00:52:25,791 --> 00:52:29,458
<i>You discussed with your family</i>
<i>and sent this divorce notice, right?</i>

970
00:52:29,541 --> 00:52:30,875
<i>Caught him properly there.</i>

971
00:52:30,958 --> 00:52:31,958
<i>Turn that off!</i>

972
00:52:32,041 --> 00:52:32,916
<i>Answer me.</i>

973
00:52:33,000 --> 00:52:34,125
Ammu!

974
00:52:34,208 --> 00:52:36,333
This is some internal plot.

975
00:52:36,916 --> 00:52:39,125
Definitely I have nothing to do
with this, Ammu.

976
00:52:40,166 --> 00:52:41,500
Shall we send the notice?

977
00:52:43,416 --> 00:52:44,333
Notice?

978
00:52:45,208 --> 00:52:47,166
But my son's life…

979
00:52:47,250 --> 00:52:48,625
He is my son too, man.

980
00:52:48,708 --> 00:52:51,458
A notice will instil fear.

981
00:52:51,541 --> 00:52:52,958
And you will get a reply from them.

982
00:52:53,625 --> 00:52:55,166
Do you want that girl home or not?

983
00:52:55,250 --> 00:52:57,083
-I do.
-You can do his signature, yes?

984
00:52:59,916 --> 00:53:01,208
PURPLE PAVI'S INTERVIEW
NOTICE FOR DIVORCE

985
00:53:01,291 --> 00:53:03,083
<i>Baldy, I'll slipper you!</i>

986
00:53:03,166 --> 00:53:04,375
<i>Stop acting, Elan.</i>

987
00:53:05,833 --> 00:53:07,958
Do you know how much I loved you?

988
00:53:08,041 --> 00:53:09,916
Hey! I loved you more than that.

989
00:53:10,000 --> 00:53:12,500
